### Page layouts (LayoutApi) — the storefront builder's write surface
### One document per page, edited as a draft under an optimistic baseVersion and published whole.

### The draft + meta (materializes the starter home on first touch)
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/layouts/HOME?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

### Save the draft (whole document; baseVersion is the draftVersion the GET returned)
PUT {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/layouts/HOME?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

{
  "baseVersion": 1,
  "document": {
    "schemaVersion": 1,
    "page": "HOME",
    "sections": [
      {
        "id": "sec-hero",
        "kind": "hero",
        "variant": "minimal",
        "props": {"height": "md"},
        "text": {"heading": {"en": "Welcome"}, "subheading": {"en": "The new season is here"}},
        "style": {"spacing": "lg", "width": "full", "tone": "default"},
        "visibility": {"hidden": false}
      }
    ]
  }
}

### Save with a stale baseVersion — 409 CONTENT.VERSION_CONFLICT
PUT {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/layouts/HOME?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

{"baseVersion": 999, "document": {"schemaVersion": 1, "page": "HOME", "sections": []}}

### Save an unrenderable document — 400 (unknown kind)
PUT {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/layouts/HOME?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

{"baseVersion": 1, "document": {"schemaVersion": 1, "page": "HOME", "sections": [{"id": "sec-x", "kind": "no-such-kind"}]}}

### Publish the draft (422 CONTENT.PUBLISH_INCOMPLETE when a media reference is not in the library)
POST {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/layouts/HOME/publish?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

{"baseVersion": 2}

### Throw the draft away — published (or the starter default) becomes the draft again
POST {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/layouts/HOME/discard?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

{"baseVersion": 2}

### Revision history (every publish, newest first)
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/layouts/HOME/revisions?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

### Restore a past published version into the draft (publishing it again is a separate step)
POST {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/layouts/HOME/revisions/1/restore?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

### Mint a 30-minute draft-preview token for the builder canvas / preview tab
POST {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/layouts/HOME/preview-token?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

### My sections — merchant-saved presets (snapshots, re-idded on insert)
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/layouts/section-presets?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

### Save the selected section as a preset
POST {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/layouts/section-presets?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

{
  "name": "My hero",
  "section": {"id": "sec-hero", "kind": "hero", "variant": "minimal", "props": {"height": "md"}, "text": {"heading": {"en": "Welcome"}}}
}

### Delete a preset
DELETE {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/layouts/section-presets/1?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}
